{"id":"n66310-1-19","stage":3,"title":"충격 · 冲击","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66310-1-19-1","ko":"이 휴대폰은 이제 못 쓰는 건가요?","zh":"这部手机现在不能用了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"휴대폰은","meaning":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","explanation":"휴대폰：手机，移动电话，手提电话；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"휴대폰","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88425","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴대폰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴대폰은","audio":"/audio/93f202d567dfcfc517f4.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰는","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰는","audio":"/audio/6f8201be65ab164072c8.mp3"}},{"text":"건가요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건가요","audio":"/audio/d23ae34a616ec8bb1263.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"2a675ee941a2897e","term":"휴대폰","zh":"手机，移动电话，手提电话","audio":"/audio/2a675ee941a2897ed209.mp3","entryId":"88425","definition":"能拿在手里或带在身上，可以接或打的无线电话。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"用，使用","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"71285","definition":"做某事时利用材料、工具等。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/a729dcc29622fe2d8d26.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66310-1-19-2","ko":"네, 땅에 떨어지면서 심한 충격을 받은 것 같습니다.","zh":"是的，看起来是掉在地上受到了严重的撞击。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"땅에","meaning":"地面","explanation":"땅：地面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"1","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅에","audio":"/audio/07b38f73df7061715871.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어지면서","meaning":"掉，下降","explanation":"떨어지다：掉，下降；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어지면서","audio":"/audio/35f16302440a1d0e66da.mp3"}},{"text":"심한","meaning":"严重","explanation":"심하다：严重；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심한","audio":"/audio/cd43d42638d16dea3a13.mp3"}},{"text":"충격을","meaning":"冲击","explanation":"충격：冲击；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"충격","audio":"/audio/947753405607bd73444a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66310","senseId":"1","lemma":"충격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"충격을","audio":"/audio/a84cc82ecdbf483fc7ca.mp3"}},{"text":"받은","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받은","audio":"/audio/135720fd9fd0e73d4239.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같습니다.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같습니다","audio":"/audio/70b461d79f2fe5361c43.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"地面","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"地面","pronunciation":["땅"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"掉，下降","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"由上往下落。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"947753405607bd73","term":"충격","zh":"冲击","audio":"/audio/947753405607bd73444a.mp3","entryId":"66310","definition":"迅猛地向物体施加的力。","pronunciation":["충격"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/21987bf6034bbea6c42c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.859,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66310","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5843,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，看起来是掉在地上受到了严重的撞击。","这部手机现在不能用了吗？","看样子你年纪似乎还比我小，哪来的资格对我用半语啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这部手机现在不能用了吗？","看样子你年纪似乎还比我小，哪来的资格对我用半语啊？","是的，看起来是掉在地上受到了严重的撞击。"],"answer":2}]}
